      en: ["The park is located in the Tanintharyi Region of southern Myanmar.", "It is a key sanctuary for the critically endangered Gurney's Pitta.", "Resident species include Malayan tapirs and Indochinese tigers.", "The area forms part of a vital trans-border wildlife corridor.", "It protects significant areas of lowland Sundaic rainforest.", "Proposed protection aims to curb illegal logging and mining."],
